00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:46.630
So the RS 2 is a more
entry level stabilizer

00:02:46.630 --> 00:02:48.410
that has a new foldable design.

00:02:48.410 --> 00:02:51.150
So you can transform it into
six different configurations

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:54.040
