00:02:59.230 --> 00:03:01.640
There's a built-in front
dial right above the trigger.

00:03:01.640 --> 00:03:04.150
So this lets you adjust the
camera's focus when paired

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:05.110
with a focus motor.

00:03:05.110 --> 00:03:07.560
This also has the same dual
layer quick-release plates,

00:03:07.560 --> 00:03:10.730
