Manfrotto and Arca-Swiss.

00:03:10.730 --> 00:03:13.100
There's a new mechanical
three axis lock as well.

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:15.200
It has a built-in one inch OLED screen

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:17.600
to check gimbal status or adjust settings.

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:19.520
You can get up to 14 hours of battery life

00:03:19.520 --> 00:03:22.611
with the two built-in
18,650 cell batteries

00:03:22.611 --> 00:03:25.080
