half, and 80% in one hour.

00:03:30.740 --> 00:03:34.360
Both of these have DJI's new
Titan Stabilization Algorithm,

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:36.610
which is their next gen stabilizing tech

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:38.140
to get even smoother shots.

00:03:38.140 --> 00:03:41.240
There's also a super smooth
function that can be activated

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:43.180
for increased motor capacity and torque

00:03:43.180 --> 00:03:44.810
for even more stable shots,

00:03:44.810 --> 00:03:47.190
